 "lede": "The agent works from the posting calendar. A slot with no approved image or video starts production, and carousels and covers come from the brand templates. Posts go out at the hours the audience is active. When a post fails on one network, the agent reads why, retries it and hands back the live links. Comments and messages are collected every couple of minutes so none sit unseen.",
